   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pol. partier UNDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pol. parties UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett UNDP projekt till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r politiska partier, som Sida   har st&#xf6;tt i mindre skala sedan 2005. Projektet utg&#xf6;r s&#xe5;ledes en       forts&#xe4;ttning av en modell f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d som genom sin flexibla och         efterfr&#xe5;gestyrda karakt&#xe4;r, har bed&#xf6;mts vara effektiva och relevanta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is UNDP project to continue and expand their work in support of  political parties, which Sida has supported since 2005. The proposed  project thus represents the continuation of a model of support which, through its flexible and demand-driven character, has been judged to  be effective and relevant.</narrative>
  </description>
